  },
  "solution_overview": "Tipperary aggregates anonymized transaction data from millions of users to calculate the median tip percentage for every restaurant within a 5-mile radius. The app features a clean interface showing the 'Local Average,' 'Your Tip,' and a 'Fairness Score' before the user enters the establishment.",
